WEBVTT

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.770
STUDIO RIKKA

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:12.310
In the future, probably Japan.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.800
Robots have long been put into practical use,

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:19.590
and practical use of androids has just begun.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.790
<i>Next up - the front page of Bankei Newspaper!</i>

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.900
<i>Android job types expand!</i>

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:41.930
<i>It's big news!</i>

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:42.860
Where's Sammy?

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:45.580
She made that, and went out a while ago.

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:46.230
Huh-

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:47.360
Maintenance?

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.250
It's so annoying - once every month.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.110
Where's it go?

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:52.320
An appliance shop?

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:53.370
Well...

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:54.960
Probably dad's place.

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:02.510
I'm sleepy, and don't feel like eating.

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:11.160
<i>Android job types expand</i>

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:15.470
<i>Androids used as school teachers?</i>

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.330
<i>Birth of android artists?</i>

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:20.580
The piano.

00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:21.450
What?

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:26.200
If you're gonna play at night, turn off the sound!

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:27.740
Even I'm losing sleep.

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:29.040
So it wasn't a dream...

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:30.500
Mom was heartbroken!

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:32.120
<i>Gone to teach voice training. 
Sammy take care of breakfast - Mom</i>

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:34.540
Says she's can't let you help with the lessons.

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:38.110
Even if I get good, what's the use?

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:44.880
<i>Hayama Junior Piano Competition</i>

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:49.960
<i>Robot gives guest performance</i>

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:54.730
<i>Grand prix - Rikuo Kikuhara</i>

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:57.470
Time of Eve

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:03.190
It doesn't have any special abilities?

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.050
Special abilities in an android?!

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.410
I found this in my old man's PC.

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:23.390
Um -

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:25.930
It's an android -

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:27.970
made to be a human being's father.

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:29.990
I've heard about it -

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:32.400
They're not actually in use.

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:34.660
They want to use them in the future.

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:36.260
Read this.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.160
<i>Operational tests conducted in secret -</i>

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:42.210
Sounds familiar, huh?

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:43.380
Not particularly.

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:45.700
It doesn't mean...he's like that.

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:48.340
It's like robots are butting into everything.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:51.610
After art, next it'll be love!

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:00.850
Masaki!

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.330
<i>Would you eat a tomato made by a machine?</i>

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:45.660
<i>House rule: No discrimination between humans and robots.</i>

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.060
Welcome!

00:03:53.970 --> 00:03:54.870
You're alone today?

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.060
It's not like we're always together.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:57.800
You are!

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.050
She's alone too?

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:00.100
Yeah...

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.740
Shimei's got something to take care of.

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:06.390
Eve's Melody

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:09.640
So you do childcare too?

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:11.330
Chie is a customer!

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:12.300
Right?

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.340
Meow...

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:21.310
What's he up to?

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:23.400
Leaving Chie on her own -

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:24.050
I'm a cat!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.410
Rikuo, don't say things like that!

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:27.080
Sure, sure...

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:32.430
Hopefully your dad will be back soon.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.880
He's not my dad!

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:34.450
Huh?

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.510
So who is he?

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:41.500
He's called my...fos-ter par-ent!

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:45.470
I'm back, Chi!

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:46.100
I'm a cat!

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:47.590
Oh, Rikuo!

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:49.260
Huh? Where's Masa?

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:50.870
It's not like we're always together!

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:52.200
Sure you are!

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:53.850
You seem kind of out of it.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:54.600
Out of it, meow.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:55.500
You're wrong!

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:57.380
Oh -

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:04.200
Chie, let's read a book!

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:06.040
I don't feel like it...

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.370
You know which book Uncle Shimei likes?

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:10.630
How about I show you?

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:11.670
Meow!

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:14.890
She's good with kids.

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:16.940
'Cause Akiko knows how to handle herself.

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:18.360
Unlike me.

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:24.060
What does Shimei do for a living?

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.390
I'm not sure what he does either.

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:28.430
Except for doting on Chie.

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:30.490
He should have taken her with him.

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:32.530
But Shimei's the one who is suffering.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.960
I kind of understand.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.360
'Cause I've taken care of her many times.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:38.190
Many times?

00:05:38.580 --> 00:05:40.280
Right, every month.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.470
Cats study too!

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:46.110
Are you OK?

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.700
I didn't get enough sleep.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:49.110
That's not what I mean.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.700
Seems like you're in a bad mood.

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:53.910
What's it matter - you all hate me anyway!

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:55.790
What do you mean by that?

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:03.110
They say there's nothing in your heart at birth.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.290
It's empty.

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:05.380
Cats too?

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:08.570
Right - but you talk with lots of people,

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:10.610
and feel and see lots of things,

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:12.480
and gradually your heart comes into being.

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:13.220
Cats too?

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:15.120
Right - but you're still a child.

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:19.020
You're going to experience lots more emotions.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:20.760
Not just Chie.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:23.190
Shimei, us, and also -

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:24.430
Rikuo?

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:29.950
The cat understands...

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:30.990
Really?!

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:33.050
Chie got scolded before...

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:38.020
Are you lonely without Shimei?

00:06:40.220 --> 00:06:42.820
Do you like Shimei?

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:43.540
Meow.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.740
Shimei goes off somewhere on his own.

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:51.770
I wonder where he goes.

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:52.490
...even though he gets lonely.

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:53.230
Rikuo!

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.430
She's just a child, you know!

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:58.610
Um - sorry!

00:06:58.690 --> 00:06:59.930
I wanna go to the bathroom.

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:02.270
It's Chie's turn!

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:03.740
Rikuo, excuse us a sec.

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:04.850
Sure.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:07.470
I can do it by myself.

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:09.650
That's my Chie!

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:13.230
Shimei first brought her to this cafe

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:15.570
quite a while ago.

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:17.070
According to that elderly gentleman,

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:20.170
she really likes it here.

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:23.110
I didn't mean to bully her.

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:24.620
But something bothers me -

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:26.110
Anyway,

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:28.850
All human beings hurt their companions sometimes.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:30.140
What are you getting at?

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:32.180
I guess that got you angry.

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:34.690
You're saying I'm a bad guy 'cause I'm a human?

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:37.020
You say some interesting things.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:42.400
Do you think robots never hurt others?

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.730
What is it that hurts others?

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.270
It's not such an easy thing to figure out.

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:49.210
What are you thoughts at that time?

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:51.400
How can you avoid hurting others?

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.300
What do you need to understand?

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.320
It's easy enough to say,

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:00.170
but quite another thing to put into action.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:13.700
Rikuo!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.420
You saved me!

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:27.220
Is that so.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:38.160
I've been so terrible.

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.940
So you're gonna do administrative justice.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:47.040
Seems not many lawyers specialize in robot law.

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:49.440
But it's still tough to get into.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:51.160
What about you?

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.160
This, after all?

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:55.850
I'm quitting.

00:08:57.740 --> 00:08:58.540
Why?

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.550
You mean, that thing the other day?

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:01.310
Yeah.

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:03.340
Forget about that.

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:05.740
It can play with precision, but...

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:08.640
It just stole a bit of the limelight.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.970
It was really...good.

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:16.190
I was moved...I think.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.430
By this?

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:18.240
Huh?

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:20.610
It's lousy.

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:23.920
Ah. Right!

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:50.920
I'm sorry.

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:52.590
I lied when I said I could play.

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:55.660
But you made it to the end...right?

00:09:55.790 --> 00:09:58.080
Really, I just picked it up by watching.

00:09:58.310 --> 00:10:01.170
I'd just heard it so many times, that's all.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:05.480
Play some more, meow!

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.760
Chie, what did you like best?

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:11.240
When it was all broken up!

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.740
Look at that!

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:47.260
Rikuo...

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:49.150
Thanks for this.

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:53.800
That's not what you were playing before!

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:58.930
Rikuo!

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:04.780
Um...I'm...

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:07.870
The thing you used to play...

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:10.680
I liked it...

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:13.680
And Chie said she wanted to hear it.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:16.670
But I've never really played it.

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:21.200
But she still enjoyed listening to it.

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:24.270
I'm sorry to have been so selfish.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:41.160
I'd tried not to play in front of you.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:44.010
And before I knew it, I'd stopped playing.

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:47.260
I'd hate it if even you got good at the piano.

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:49.270
Rikuo...

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:53.220
But..

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.250
To hell with all that!

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.090
I want to hear more!

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:07.600
Sammy might play for you!

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:09.460
Meow!

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:11.090
I'm so happy.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:14.690
She's hasn't been that happy for a long time.

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:17.080
It was no big deal...

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.950
And as for me...

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:23.910
I left her on her own again.

00:14:24.360 --> 00:14:26.760
You can't take her with you?

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:30.420
I don't want to show it to her yet.

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:32.590
Shimei, could it be that you're...?

00:14:32.710 --> 00:14:36.010
She needs me.

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:39.250
So I devote myself to her.

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:41.760
She is everything to me.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:46.270
My only wish is to make her happy.

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:49.830
Like your performance...

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:51.640
That's why I was so happy.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.870
These feelings are genuine.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:57.610
I was moved by your performance, I swear.

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:01.330
It's OK to say that kind of thing?

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:03.600
Just don't tell Nagi.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:06.100
Have you seen Sammy?

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.960
Come to think of it...

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.370
I think she left when I came in.

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:13.050
So she's gone...

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:20.630
I want everything...

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:25.580
But even if I get it...

00:15:25.760 --> 00:15:27.760
Only your warmth...

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.060
For your hard work.

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:44.780
About Sammy...

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:46.850
What?

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:50.370
She makes a lot of friends...

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:52.540
It's not like I'm angry!

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:04.370
You were really great.

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:07.110
This cafe -

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:12.440
You know, I kind of like it...

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:14.550
Thank you.

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:18.790
Rikuo!

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.550
Right. I'll explain it at the next meeting.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:29.460
I'm home.

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:32.110
Anyway, take a look at the records.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:34.640
Regardless of what the upper eschelon say,

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:38.690
this is the best way to study them all.

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:14.330
Animation production: Studio Rikka  Produced by: DIRECTIONS, INC.

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:17.730
Producer: Tom Nagae

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:21.010
Story, script, direction: Yasuhiro YOSHIURA

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:24.090
Preview
